From: Zijun Hu <zijuhu@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 31 Dec 2024 10:34:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Btdiag: Support QUTS connection mode

Support QUTS connection mode.

Signed-off-by: Zijun Hu <zijuhu@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 Btdiag.c         |  9 ++++---
 connection.c     |  5 +++-
 connection.h     | 10 ++++++++
